#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:22
msgid ""
"Application callers can hold an `operation_guard` across one registered "
"effect, obtain a separate response-scope guard, enumerate only the exact "
"human owner's live leases, read safe status projections, or lock their "
"own lease / have a human owner revoke a selected session. The distinction"
" matters: a response-scope decision does not mint a transaction proof. "
"Lifecycle hooks revoke connection trees on disconnect, invalidate "
"matching grants/keys/logins, sweep stale sessions, and close all "
"authority. Retirement removes the leases from the authorization map "
"before potentially fallible worker cleanup; failures remain pending for "
"retry and are surfaced as an exception group. Loss of automation custody "
"revokes automation leases while independently valid human leases may "
"remain. session_authority_access.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/session_authority_access.py`) "
