#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:24
msgid "Profile data, validation, and views"
msgstr "Datos del perfil, validación y vistas"

#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:26
msgid ""
"`ProfileValidationService` judges a complete merged fact set against an "
"injected schema. It routes value-shape decisions to the domain authority "
"and reports stable issue codes for invalid enum/date/number/boolean/email"
" values, unknown paths, attempted writes to derived selectors, and "
"malformed indexed instances. Only required and conditional-required "
"absences count as incompleteness that can be deferred during setup; "
"malformed values and forbidden fields block even an incomplete profile. "
"Clears are admitted even for retired or derived paths so operators can "
"remove obsolete stored values, while cleared facts no longer contribute "
"to presence or projections. Required-field checking uses row-aware "
"helpers and effective facts. `reject_invalid_profile_facts` is the shared"
" write boundary and checks the whole resulting sequence so an invalid "
"batch cannot be partly applied. validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`)"
msgstr ""
"`ProfileValidationService` evalúa un conjunto completo combinado de "
"hechos frente a un esquema inyectado. Dirige las decisiones de estructura"
" de valores a la autoridad del dominio e informa de códigos estables de "
"incidencias para valores no válidos de enumeración, fecha, número, "
"booleano y correo electrónico, rutas desconocidas, intentos de escribir "
"selectores derivados e instancias indexadas mal formadas. Solo las "
"ausencias obligatorias y condicionalmente obligatorias cuentan como "
"incompletitud aplazable durante la configuración; los valores mal "
"formados y campos prohibidos bloquean incluso un perfil incompleto. Se "
"admiten borrados incluso para rutas retiradas o derivadas para que los "
"operadores puedan eliminar valores almacenados obsoletos, mientras que "
"los hechos borrados dejan de contribuir a presencia o proyecciones. La "
"comprobación de campos obligatorios utiliza funciones auxiliares "
"conscientes de filas y hechos efectivos. `reject_invalid_profile_facts` "
"es el límite compartido de escritura y comprueba toda la secuencia "
"resultante para impedir aplicar parcialmente un lote no válido. "
"validation.py (`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) "
"validation.py (`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) "
"validation.py (`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) "
"validation.py (`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) "
